Type: desktop-application
ID: org.gnome.Shotwell-Profile-Browser
Package: shotwell
Name:
  C: Shotwell Profile Browser
Summary:
  C: Manage Different Profiles In Shotwell
Description:
  C: >-
    <p>Shotwell is a digital photo organizer designed for the GNOME desktop environment. It allows you to import photos, pictures,
    images and videos from disk or camera. Shotwell can organize them in collections and in other various ways. The viewer
    shows them in full-window or fullscreen mode and presents them as galleries or slideshows. The integrated editor can rotate,
    flip, crop and tag the photos, adjust the colors und remove red eyes. Export is possible to facebook, Flickr or Youtube
    to share with others. It is able to manage a lot of image formats such as JPEG, PNG, BMP, TIFF and Raw CR2.</p>
  en: >-
    <p>Shotwell is a digital photo organizer designed for the GNOME desktop environment. It allows you to import photos, pictures,
    images and videos from disk or camera. Shotwell can organize them in collections and in other various ways. The viewer
    shows them in full-window or fullscreen mode and presents them as galleries or slideshows. The integrated editor can rotate,
    flip, crop and tag the photos, adjust the colors und remove red eyes. Export is possible to facebook, Flickr or Youtube
    to share with others. It is able to manage a lot of image formats such as JPEG, PNG, BMP, TIFF and Raw CR2.</p>
Categories:
- Graphics
- Photography
Icon:
  cached:
